Q1. Write a python program to accept a string, extract all words that start with a capital letter and remove all special characters from a string. Display modified string.

[10 Marks]

# Q1 Solution

import re

string = input("Enter a string: ")

# Remove special characters (keep only letters and spaces)
cleaned = re.sub(r'[^A-Za-z\s]', '', string)

words = cleaned.split()

# Extract words starting with capital letter
capital_words = [word for word in words if word[0].isupper()]

print("Modified string (without special characters):")
print(cleaned)

print("Words starting with capital letters:")
print(capital_words)


